{"id":"688115347","kind":"article","title":"更倾向于「记忆系统」而非「间隔重复系统」","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zKa9YkyLmK8ynFKCWZBDBpk"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2024-03-20","updated":"2025-07-16","votes":24,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":576,"keywords":["记忆系统","间隔重复","检索练习","助记媒介","卡片设计"],"summary":"作者认为“间隔重复系统”这一名称过度突出时间安排机制，更值得关注的是能编码、练习和巩固知识的通用记忆系统。卡片设计与提取练习可能比间隔参数更重要；助记媒介卡还可穿插在阅读中，使首次学习不依赖重复。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/688115347","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"RkZhI7mg\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4JuirVwUcoGL4wZ8dM6Los\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Michael Nielsen</a> 在他的文章<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6yDMhNY6M7tp6UtnRBhe6G\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《如何普及记忆系统？》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>中指出，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2D1qPwddPktBjpNuwYFVva\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>这一表达不恰当地过分强调了某一特定机制。实际上，令人兴奋的是一般意义上的记忆系统（甚至可以说是<b>练习</b>系统——<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zUdBBp4QwMGcUujgfbyBZcC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">也许是「练习系统」，而不是「记忆系统」</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>）。间隔重复只是众多重要概念中的一个（确切地说，是其中的几个），这些概念将在创建强大的此类系统中发挥重要作用。例如，将概念编码进<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zXA8c6XtMLgRCGwJFGnZUvw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">提取练习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>卡片的不同方法，可能比间隔安排的细节更为重要。<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zKPv6qkSErdRGqyryvgS2wS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>的感受在很大程度上取决于最初的复习——<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zTzb8spnoqzxs3mkvPKprmn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>（实际上没有间隔，也没有重复！）</p><p data-pid=\"joOLt58L\">问：为什么更倾向于「记忆系统」而非「间隔重复系统」？</p><p data-pid=\"w59cOtay\">答：……</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"-nSWUfyX\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）</a></li><li data-pid=\"tPZOG2V6\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"688186934\" href=\"#/post/688186934\">也许是「练习系统」，而不是「记忆系统」</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"d9VaMLfi\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 GPT-4，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zKa9YkyLmK8ynFKCWZBDBpk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Prefer “memory system” to “spaced repetition system” (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 如何普及记忆系统？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"650479871\" href=\"#/post/650479871\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 也许是「练习系统」，而不是「记忆系统」 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"688186934\" href=\"#/post/688186934\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 提取练习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1928747840647168044\" href=\"#/post/1928747840647168044\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 助记媒介（Mnemonic medium） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463608296\" href=\"#/post/463608296\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"677540148","title":"一些创新洞察依赖于长期记忆","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"688186934","title":"也许是「练习系统」，而不是「记忆系统」","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":71,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"463608296","title":"助记媒介卡片穿插在阅读过程中","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"459483765","title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"650479871","title":"如何普及记忆系统？","author":"Michael Nielsen","votes":92,"minutes":23,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"412012134","title":"JAnki：写给程序员们的 13 条 Anki 使用经验","author":"Jack Kinsella","votes":148,"minutes":10,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「检索练习」· Jack Kinsella"}],"rec_answers":[]}